OL,3,GNEWSA'Dilapidated' phone box
OL,4,Atransformed into library
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disused phone box in a village has
OL,7,Fbeen transformed into a community
OL,8,Flibrary and book exchange.
OL,10,FThe classic 1930s red box in Mousehole,
OL,11,FCornwall was bought by charity, the
OL,12,FSolomon Browne Hall from British
OL,13,FTelecom (BT) two yeas ago, for just #1
OL,14,Fas part of the companies 'Adopt a
OL,15,FKiosk' scheme.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
