OL,3,GNEWSA'Dilapidated' phone box
OL,4,Atransformed into library
OL,5,
OL,6,FStacia Smales Hill came up with the
OL,7,Fidea to restore the "dilapidated" old
OL,8,Fbox located on Chapel Street into a
OL,9,Flibrary, which she said would operate
OL,10,Fin a "take one, you put one back or you
OL,11,Ftake one and you bring it back" style
OL,12,Fsystem.
OL,14,FShe said there was lots of excitement
OL,15,Famongst the community and she could not
OL,16,F"feel more proud of how the village has
OL,17,Ftaken to this and embraced it".
